Quoting  guns <sungmustpae@gmail.com>:
>But how does one prevent the hp augmentation?

The second argument to healup() is the max HP augmentation. If you are
trying to cut alchemy down, I suggest halving the effect of diluted
potions on MaxHP and changing alchemy so that when diluted potions are
alchemised only half of them survive the experience.

More generally, however, I would suggest that any MaxHP increasing
activity be subject to a cap of some kind, perhaps a multiple of (XL plus
some small fiddle factor).
